    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49745" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰατρ-εῖον</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰητρεῖον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>surgery</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				405a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				647.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἰητρεῖον
				ἀνόσως διάγειν</span> not to be so ill <i>as to need
				medical advice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχῆς ἰ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.49
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>remedy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Androm.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.832
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> pl.,= 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴατρα</span>”
