					1
				</span></i>
			, <i>doctor's fee, expense of a cure</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				21.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.177
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.186
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
